# `.sanity-overlay/` is COMMITTED, deliberately.
#
# It is the mechanism by which branch state travels with the branch: PRD §14.3
# fixes canonical serialization precisely so `intent.json` produces a stable Git
# diff, §38.1 accepts `[M-LOCAL]` partly on "Git diff is deterministic", and
# §23 has a preview deployment read *committed* intent and snapshot files out of
# the deployment bundle. A blanket ignore here was added in error on 2026-08-04
# and removed on 2026-08-05 — it silently defeated all three.
#
# The local runtime scratch is excluded by the `.gitignore` that FsOverlayStore
# writes inside `.sanity-overlay/` itself, so it is not repeated here — the store
# owns its own layout. Checkpoints intentionally drop the transaction log
# (PRD §29.1/§29.2), so a fresh clone with no `.runtime/` is the documented,
# supported state.

# Throwaway demo fixture for examples/local-site, regenerated by `pnpm seed`.
